elementor-element elementor-element-5bc7e06 dce_masking-none elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"5bc7e06\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"249\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/c0865101-1024x319.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-393\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/c0865101-1024x319.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/c0865101-300x93.jpg 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/c0865101-768x239.jpg 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/c0865101-1536x478.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/c0865101.jpg 1700w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bfe3527 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bfe3527\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Co je to kalibrace? \u201cKalibrace je soubor \u00fakon\u016f, p\u0159i kter\u00fdch se zji\u0161\u0165uje hodnota kalibrovan\u00e9ho m\u011b\u0159idla a porovn\u00e1v\u00e1 s \u00a0odpov\u00eddaj\u00edc\u00ed zn\u00e1mou hodnotou etalonu\u201d. Kvalifikace je pak stupe\u0148 valida\u010dn\u00edho procesu a je individu\u00e1ln\u00edch \u010d\u00e1st\u00ed procesu. P\u0159esn\u00e9 po\u017eadavky kvalifikace a kalibrace jsou z\u00e1visl\u00e9 na dan\u00e9 aplikaci.<\/p><p><strong>Kvalifikace m\u00e1 \u010dty\u0159i \u010d\u00e1sti (The 4 Q\u2019s):<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Design Qualification (DQ)<\/li><li>Installation Qualification (IQ)<\/li><li>Operational Qualification (OQ)<\/li><li>Performance Qualification (PQ)<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/di